    "reveal: the whole map explored at the start",
    "epochs: epoch advances are free and always affordable",
    "extra: computer_player_extra_resources (row 101) gold and iron at the start",
    "popband: the pop cap pulled toward the largest human population (rows 92/93)",
    "catchup: the epoch rubber band (pulled forward when behind, held back when ahead of every human)",
    "retire: obsolete units no human sees are deleted"
